Federal Act on Foreign Nationals (FNA) (FNA)
SR 142.20 — Federal Act of 16 December 2005 on Foreign Nationals (FNA).
|

:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/2007/758]
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.
This English text is the consolidation of 1 February 2026. The binding German, French and Italian texts have since been consolidated to 12 June 2026, so this translation is behind current law.

:INFO
Preamble
The Federal Assembly of the Swiss Confederation,
on the basis of Article 121 paragraph 1 of the Federal Constitution, and having considered the Dispatch of the Federal Council dated 8 March 2002,
decrees:
